    "fullContentHtml":  "\n\u003ch1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\"\u003eRSSB REET Mains Upper Teacher Result 2026\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\"\u003ePost Date: \u003ctime class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-04T22:19:21+05:30\"\u003eJune 4, 2026\u003c/time\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cspan class=\"custom-post-time\"\u003e10:19 pm\u003c/span\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://rssb.rajasthan.gov.in/\"\u003eRajasthan Staff Selection Board (RSSB)\u003c/a\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e has released the\u003cstrong\u003e Result\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;on its\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eofficial website\u003c/strong\u003e for the Recruitment of \u003cstrong\u003eMains Upper Teacher\u0026nbsp;Examination 2025.\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;The\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eExam\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cspan data-teams=\"true\"\u003ewas conducted on\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;17-20 January 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e,\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;The\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eRSSB\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;application process started on\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"339\"\u003e07 November 2025\u003c/strong\u003e, and candidates were able to submit their applications until\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"424\"\u003e06 December 2025\u003c/strong\u003e. Candidates can check their\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eResult \u003c/strong\u003eusing their\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"362\"\u003eEnrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\u003cdiv class=\"social-buttons\"\u003e\u003c!-- WhatsApp Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e WhatsApp \u003c/a\u003e \u003c!-- Telegram Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e Telegram \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\"\u003eRSSB REET Mains Upper Teacher Result 2026 – Updated\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\u003ch3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\"\u003eRSSB REET Mains Upper Teacher Examination 2025 : Short Details\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/rssb-reet-mains-upper-teacher-2026/\"\u003eSarkariResult.com.cm\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant Dates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eShort Notice Date : \u003cstrong\u003e17 July 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOnline Apply Start Date : \u003cstrong\u003e07 November 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOnline Apply Last Date : \u003cstrong\u003e06 December 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eLast Date For Fee Payment : \u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e06 December 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\"\u003eExam Date : \u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\"\u003e17 – 20 January 2026\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAdmit Card :\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e12 January 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAnswer Key : \u003cstrong\u003e27 February 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eResult Date : \u003cstrong\u003e27 May 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFinal Answer Key : \u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e03 June 2026 Available Now\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCandidates are advised to confirm from the \u003cstrong\u003eRSSB\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eofficial website.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApplication Fee\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFor\u003cstrong\u003e General, EWS, OBC (Creamy Layer) \u003c/strong\u003e: \u003cstrong\u003e₹ 600/-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFor\u003cstrong\u003e EWS, OBC (Non Creamy Layer)\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;: \u003cstrong\u003e₹ 400/-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFor \u003cstrong\u003eSC, ST, PH\u003c/strong\u003e : \u003cstrong\u003e₹ 400/-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFor \u003cstrong\u003eCorrection Charge : ₹ 300/-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePayment Mode (Online):\u003c/strong\u003e You can make the payment using the following methods:\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eDebit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCredit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eInternet Banking\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eIMPS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCash Card / Mobile Wallet\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\"\u003e\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\"\u003eRSSB REET Mains Upper Teacher Notification 2025 : Age Limits As On 01 January 2026\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMinimum Age : \u003cstrong\u003e18 Years\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMaximum Age : \u003cstrong\u003e40 Years\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRSSB\u003c/strong\u003e provides age relaxation for the \u003cstrong\u003eREET Mains\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eUpper Teacher \u003c/strong\u003eposition as per their regulations.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb