003ctr style=\"height: 89px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; height: 89px;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e For which post is the \u003cstrong\u003eREET Mains Upper Teacher exam conducted?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e It is conducted for the \u003cstrong data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"369\"\u003eUpper Primary Teacher (Level-2)\u003c/strong\u003e post.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 117px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; height: 117px;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"pt-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e Has the \u003cstrong\u003eRSSB REET Mains Upper Teacher Answer Key 2026\u003c/strong\u003e been announced?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e Yes, the admit card has been officially announced through the RSSB exam schedule.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 117px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; height: 117px;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e When will the \u003cstrong\u003eREET Mains Upper Teacher Exam 2025 be held?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer: The exam will be conducted on the dates mentioned in the official RSSB exam calendar.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 89px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; height: 89px;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e What is the official website for \u003cb\u003eRSSB\u003c/b\u003e?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The official website for \u003cstrong\u003eRSSB\u003c/strong\u003e is \u003cstrong\u003ehttps://rssb.rajasthan.gov.in/\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-30980 aligncenter\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/RSSB-REET.jpg\" alt=\"RSSB REET Mains Upper Teacher Answer Key 2026\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/RSSB-REET.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/RSSB-REET-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/RSSB-REET-768x432.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp cla